{"id":"bb045b68eb24d902","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-ce-independent-sequence.md","title":"统一 c.e. 的可数可计算独立列","display":"thm-ce-independent-sequence — 统一 c.e. 的可数可计算独立列","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-ce-independent-sequence","aliases":["20-thm-ce-independent-sequence"],"display":"thm-ce-independent-sequence — 统一 c.e. 的可数可计算独立列","chapter":"7","section":"7.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 7.3.6(i)","source_printed_pages":[154,155],"source_pdf_pages":[188,189],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable-independence]]","[[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]","[[20-lem-one-action-priority-bound]]","[[20-lem-use-preservation]]","[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","[[20-thm-smn]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-ce-independent-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-ce-independent-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ce-independent-sequence — 统一 c.e. 的可数可计算独立列"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 7.3.6(i)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>154</span><span>155</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>188</span><span>189</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"96978d2a748174af\" href=\"?note=96978d2a748174af\" title=\"20-df-computable-independence\">20-df-computable-independence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" href=\"?note=fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" title=\"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence\">20-df-uniform-ce-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d6ac440f71a3538\" href=\"?note=5d6ac440f71a3538\" title=\"20-lem-one-action-priority-bound\">20-lem-one-action-priority-bound</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fec296dc8eb84564\" href=\"?note=fec296dc8eb84564\" title=\"20-lem-use-preservation\">20-lem-use-preservation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>可数 join 按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle i,x\\rangle\">\\(\\langle i,x\\rangle\\)</span> 编码；优先序有效遍历全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(i,e)\">\\((i,e)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"96978d2a748174af\" href=\"?note=96978d2a748174af\" title=\"20-df-computable-independence\">20-df-computable-independence</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" href=\"?note=fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" title=\"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence\">20-df-uniform-ce-sequence</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5d6ac440f71a3538\" href=\"?note=5d6ac440f71a3538\" title=\"20-lem-one-action-priority-bound\">20-lem-one-action-priority-bound</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"fec296dc8eb84564\" href=\"?note=fec296dc8eb84564\" title=\"20-lem-use-preservation\">20-lem-use-preservation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ce\\text{-}independent\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\exists\\vec A=(A_i)_{i\\in\\omega}\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{UniformCE}(\\vec A)\\land\\operatorname{CompIndependent}(\\vec A)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ce\\text{-}independent\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\exists\\vec A=(A_i)_{i\\in\\omega}\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{UniformCE}(\\vec A)\\land\\operatorname{CompIndependent}(\\vec A)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(i,e)\">\\((i,e)\\)</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\">\\(A_i\\)</span> 内保留一个全局从未使用的见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，只允许这个策略改变该位。每个策略在对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\">\\(A_i\\)</span> 中有自己的可计算无限见证子列。选择见证时令全局编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle i,x\\rangle\">\\(\\langle i,x\\rangle\\)</span> 大于所有更高策略的现有限制。等待 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^{J_{\\ne i}(\\vec A_s)}(x)\">\\(\\Phi_e^{J_{\\ne i}(\\vec A_s)}(x)\\)</span> 的有界模拟输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>；然后枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\">\\(A_i\\)</span>，保护这个删列 oracle 上的停止 use，标记已行动并初始化全部较低策略。</p>\n<p>本次枚举不改变自己的删列 oracle。其他较低策略若向 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\">\\(A_j\\)</span> 枚举一个新位，其全局编码在所有更高限制之外；当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j=i\">\\(j=i\\)</span> 时更是根本不影响该删列 oracle。因此已行动而不再初始化的策略保留零输出不同。每次初始化之间至多行动一次，计数引理给出每个策略有限次初始化。取最终见证，若始终不行动，它在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\">\\(A_i\\)</span> 中保持为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>；若真实泛函等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{A_i}\">\\(\\chi_{A_i}\\)</span>，其零计算最终出现，且所有更高策略已不再行动，迫使该策略行动，矛盾。</p>\n<p>阶段仅维护有限多个活跃策略及有限枚举矩阵，采用最小需行动策略的公平调度；每个固定较低策略在更高有限行动结束后都能获得机会。因此整体矩阵 c.e.，统一提取各列给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniformCE}\">\\(\\operatorname{UniformCE}\\)</span>，所有独立性要求成立。这里需比较全局配对编码与 restraint，不能只比较列内见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 7.3.6(i)；印刷页 154, 155；PDF 第 188, 189 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable-independence","status":"resolved","id":"96978d2a748174af","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-independence]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"fc75264a5ecdc3fb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-one-action-priority-bound","status":"resolved","id":"5d6ac440f71a3538","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-one-action-priority-bound]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-use-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"fec296dc8eb84564","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-use-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"reso